These wallpapers come from the Omarchy gruvbox theme
(https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/tree/63f60f4fcc4786d97e5c0384be640bcdef46f9a1/themes/gruvbox/backgrounds).
WebP originals are converted to JPEG. Omarchy ships them under its MIT license
but does not name the original artists.

1-the-backwater.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/fd952c23 (added as "The Backwater"; painting, artist not credited upstream)
2-flower-basket.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/e921ea3c (by @OldJobobo; painting, artist not credited upstream)
3-village-square.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/e921ea3c (by @OldJobobo; painting, artist not credited upstream)
4-idyllic-procession.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/e921ea3c (by @OldJobobo; painting, artist not credited upstream)
5-leaves.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/e921ea3c (by @OldJobobo; photo, author not credited upstream)

